<title>NORWAY: Norway's Jan foreign trade surplus 11.1 bln NOK.</title>
<headline>Norway's Jan foreign trade surplus 11.1 bln NOK.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statstics Norway issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes shipping and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	JAN 1997    DEC 1996    JAN 1996</p>
<p> Imports			    17.71	 18.30	 16.55</p>
<p> Exports			    28.84	 27.57	 24.54</p>
<p> Balance			    11.13	  9.27	  7.99</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas		-4.05	 -6.08	 -3.25</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
